<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-backed suspects are accused of plotting attacks on a U.K. base that hosts U.S. jets, while a separate Iran-backed trio is linked to a drone strike on the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan that halted production and cut power. Iraqi security officials tied the Khor Mor attack to internal disputes and announced plans to expand air-defence deployments, while a suspect was arrested for killing his brother in Shamamak. Iraq is sending a delegation to Lebanon after former MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found dead there, and the parliament speaker ordered a probe into alleged oil smuggling to Afghanistan. The prime minister's aide said there is no deadline for disarming militias this year. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB6ZEFrRTFCdzBsUHhxSGVwZlAwNHhkX3hKZjZEWjdqNE5DMWJvZmdRNXpORHlxYmlkOUZXVnhkSzlyYkg3dVIwWHZiMzFxTDBpYkJUejlYSTZRUWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5odkd1bGZOWGdpeXpQNlNHcWhfR3NTem9XcURWQnRIbHFBQ3paSzd1U0dhWWFxVG92UkxGX0ZpY0J5Z1dYSW13UUJRVkRXZGROUEhnWTFQT2Qwajd5c3dUWE95VW9VbWR4dVlkSVpscFVheDRtVkRNZS1tSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQSFVrS1NMR2MzYjNJRkpxV1VkQkgxMVRwSXZ2Sy15TF9WN3V0X0dGVEw3Tk5iUW9USW10WVBhd01xc3BzVnZqa0F6WjBfNXR3RV84R0hiQTB5YWEyOUw1bHVqOWY0cE9zemJ3T2JvaGZmal93Y2dmTjhwM3pEMEJKV2pGYUliVHlSdmxZQmhRUnZPYjRhVW9rVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQbUtsaHQ2QzJXMlBELWNMQkRBZHJTb0NPZG9XNEg5dk5NTUpUa295cVgzLUVmSFFjbmpBUUhUeW9OMGwybG5sdHY1SVlHMTBXc2FmX2x4eHJLZkxLeXN2R0FHVjNUUFZHQS0yMnRHTDNtdlB4T3hxMWk3dGtKckZwLV8yTGt2UjhIX3FuSHcxOUtFOXJSUnctdU1XRTh3LTBWbExSbHdRYVgwd3NF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ